# What "fluid_styled_content" does to "lib.contentElement" when it is loaded
# after the theme: its "Helper/ContentElement.typoscript" starts with exactly
# this line, on v12.4 and v13.4, and builds the object again from nothing.
#
# Loaded after the theme by "ThemeContentElementObjectTest", which renders the
# theme's own content elements with it in place.
lib.contentElement >
